        "x1": 188.5,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A A career in sales"
      },
      {
        "y": 97.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 451.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "When Carl left school, he took the first job he was offered – in telesales1. He thought"
      },
      {
        "y": 109.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 489.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "telemarketing2 sounded quite glamorous but soon found that most of the people he phoned"
      },
      {
        "y": 121.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 509.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "hated cold calling3 and put the phone down when he tried the hard sell4. However, he persevered"
      },
      {
        "y": 133.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 501,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and found he became quite skilled at persuading customers to part with their money5. He then"
      },
      {
        "y": 145.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 495.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "moved into a job on a TV shopping channel6, where he specialised in selling merchandise7 for"
      },
      {
        "y": 158.7,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 498.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the leisure market. He did so well at this that he set up his own sportswear company and hasn’t"
      },
      {
        "y": 169.8,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 190.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "looked back8 since."
      },
      {
        "y": 196.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 372.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 + 2 selling or marketing goods and services by phone 5 spend money"
      },
      {
        "y": 208.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 474.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 phoning people who have not requested a call in 6 a TV channel devoted to selling products"
      },
      {
        "y": 219.4,
        "x0": 104.3,
        "x1": 319.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "order to try to sell them something 7"
      },
      {
        "y": 221.4,
        "x0": 321.5,
        "x1": 450.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "products that are bought and sold"
      },
      {
        "y": 230.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 294.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 attempt to sell something by being very forceful or"
      },
      {
        "y": 232.4,
        "x0": 316.4,
        "x1": 441.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 has moved forward successfully"
      },
      {
        "y": 241.4,
        "x0": 104.3,
        "x1": 144.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "persuasive"
      },
      {
        "y": 258.4,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 200.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Buying and selling"
      },
      {
        "y": 276.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 507.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A person’s purchasing power is the ability they have to buy goods, i.e. the amount of money they"
      },
      {
        "y": 288.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 162,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "have available."
      },
      {
        "y": 300.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 466.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "If you shop around, you try different companies or shops to see which offers best value."
      },
      {
        "y": 312.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 521.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "If you want to buy something, you need to find a shop that stocks it. [keeps a supply of it = keeps it in stock]"
      },
      {
        "y": 324.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 519.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "If you trade something up, usually a car or a house, you buy one that is of higher value than the one"
      },
      {
        "y": 336.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 251.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "you had before. (opp. = trade down)"
      },
      {
        "y": 348.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 511.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "People sometimes make a purchasing decision based on brand loyalty. [confidence in that particular"
      },
      {
        "y": 361.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 256.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "make and a tendency always to choose it]"
      },
      {
        "y": 372.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 505.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Supermarkets sometimes sell an item for less than it costs them in order to attract a lot of people"
      },
      {
        "y": 384.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 510.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "into the shop, where they will also buy more profitable items – the item being sold at a low price is"
      },
      {
        "y": 396.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 184.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "called a loss leader."
      },
      {
        "y": 408.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 461.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "For a company to sell its products, it has to price them appropriately. [give them a price]"
      },
      {
        "y": 420.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 519,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "If a company finds a niche market, it finds a specialised group of customers with particular interests"
      },
      {
        "y": 432.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 220.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "that that company can meet."
      },
      {
        "y": 444.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 503.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "If an item is said to come/go under the hammer, it is sold at an auction. [sale of goods or property"
      },
      {
        "y": 456.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 455.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "where people make gradually increasing bids and the item is then sold to the highest bidder]"
      },
      {
        "y": 473.9,
        "x0": 75,
        "x1": 208.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "C A career in business"
      },
      {
        "y": 500.3,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 482.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A few years ago Tina started her own software development business, which turned out to be"
      },
      {
        "y": 511.2,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 471.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "very lucrative1. However, she got increasingly irritated by all the red tape2 involved in the"
      },
      {
        "y": 523.2,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 490.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "administration3 of a business and when a larger company contacted her with a proposition4,"
      },
      {
        "y": 535.2,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 499.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "suggesting a takeover5, she was interested. At first, the two companies could not agree on all the"
      },
      {
        "y": 547.2,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 493.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "details of the agreement but they managed to reach a compromise6 and hammer out a deal7"
      },
      {
        "y": 559.2,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 497.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "without too much delay. In many ways Tina was sad that her company had been swallowed up8"
      },
      {
        "y": 571.2,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 485.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "but she has used the money raised by the sale of her capital assets9 to invest in10 a business"
      },
      {
        "y": 583.2,
        "x0": 109.2,
        "x1": 343.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "start-up11: an online holiday property letting agency12."
      },
      {
        "y": 608.2,
        "x0": 102.5,
        "x1": 507.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 producing a lot of money 7 talk in detail until a business agreement is made"
      },
      {
        "y": 620.2,
