      },
      {
        "y": 202.9,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 371.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Look at A and B opposite. Fill the gaps in these sentences."
      },
      {
        "y": 219.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 463.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 A world-famous painting will go the hammer in London tomorrow."
      },
      {
        "y": 231.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 429.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 It’s a sensible idea to shop a bit before buying a computer."
      },
      {
        "y": 243.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 531.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 Sally made the right decision when she quit her old job and set up her own business – she hasn’t"
      },
      {
        "y": 255.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 317,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "looked since the day it opened."
      },
      {
        "y": 267.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 533.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 I don’t mind trying a hard sell on a person who has already expressed an interest in our products,"
      },
      {
        "y": 279.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 259,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "but I hate calling."
      },
      {
        "y": 291.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 433,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 It can be quite hard to persuade my dad to with his money."
      },
      {
        "y": 303.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 486.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 I’m going to make a for the dining table that is up for auction tomorrow."
      },
      {
        "y": 315.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 410,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 My current job is in . I spend all the day on the phone."
      },
      {
        "y": 327.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 496,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 They produce special clothes for people who practise yoga and have really cornered this"
      },
      {
        "y": 339.3,
        "x0": 186.5,
        "x1": 219,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "market."
      },
      {
        "y": 351.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 504.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 The shop I went to didn’t the printer I wanted so I’m going to order it online."
      },
      {
        "y": 367.7,
        "x0": 85.1,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7.3"
      },
      {
        "y": 370.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 486.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Replace the underlined words with a word or phrase from C with a similar meaning."
      },
      {
        "y": 386.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 536.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 As their business interests were quite different, it took them a long time to come to an agreement."
      },
      {
        "y": 398.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 503.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 If you want to go into the import and export business, you had better be prepared for a lot"
      },
      {
        "y": 410.7,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 192.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "of bureaucracy."
      },
      {
        "y": 422.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 466.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 At the moment they are discussing the possibility of buying up another company."
